{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":17584701,"ns":0,"title":"Arithmetic dynamics","extract":"Arithmetic dynamics is a field that amalgamates two areas of mathematics, dynamical systems and number theory. Part of the inspiration comes from complex dynamics, the study of the iteration of self-maps of the complex plane or other complex algebraic varieties.","description":"Field of mathematics","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}